# OpenAI ranking

- Use `rank_segments_by_rubric(client, model=..., segments=[{segment_id, text}, ...])` for ordering.
- Model must return a **permutation** of all input `segment_id` values (`ordered_segment_ids`).
- Spec: `docs/pipeline/scoring-and-selection/llm-assisted-ranking.md`.
